  "title": "移除星澄 Ollama teacher 路徑：教師改為純原生自我蒸餾",
  "summary": "Governor directive 2026-10-02: remove the Ollama teacher path from the xingcheng architecture/data surfaces. B154 is revised so teacher distillation is no longer a registered Ollama demand; xingcheng teacher data is produced only by the native self-distillation lane (NativeDistillationPlane on governed xc-fused-1 weights and lifecycle-verified generations), and an external model service is never a xingcheng teacher. All other B154 on-demand lifecycle rules (LOCAL-MODEL-DEMAND, PACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER, audit/ownership clauses) are unchanged. Code removal (TeacherCollect Ollama collector, --teacher-collect, teacher-distillation.json, diagram nodes) follows as implementation, never inside this request.",
  "requested_by": "decision-sovereign",
  "origin": "human-governor directive: 移除 Ollama 路徑：星澄架構、資料圖仍有 Ollama teacher，改為純原生教師／自我蒸餾",
  "change_class": "authority-duty",
