  "problem": {
    "summary": "B154 still registers teacher distillation as an explicit Ollama demand, so xingcheng architecture and data surfaces (diagrams, TeacherCollect lane, teacher-distillation.json) keep an external-model teacher dependency. The governed direction is native-only: teacher signal must come from self-distillation on the single canonical stack, never a loopback external service."
  },
  "changes": [
    {
      "table": "articles",
      "key": {
        "provision_id": "B154"
      },
      "field": "rule",
      "proposed": "Ollama is a registered external service with on-demand lifecycle,not a resident startup dependency. It starts only for an explicit registered need such as expert consultation,embeddings,reranking or approved model routing,through governed lazy activation;it unloads when idle under resource policy. XINGCHENG-TEACHER-NATIVE:teacher distillation is no longer a registered Ollama demand;Xingcheng teacher data is produced only by the native self-distillation lane (the NativeDistillationPlane operating on governed xc-fused-1 weights and lifecycle-verified generations),and an external model service is never a xingcheng teacher. Startup probes may inspect availability without starting or pre-warming the service. Start and stop are audited in the Process Registry;GPTBridge may stop only an instance it started,while a user-started instance may only receive a governed request. Failed start reports degraded and never silently switches paths;after shutdown only a new explicit demand or single-item permission may restart it. Cold-start and first-token latency remain observable evidence. LOCAL-MODEL-DEMAND:an explicitly authorized local-model activation is a registered Ollama demand. The local-model lifecycle first checks installation and readiness,starts Ollama only when installed but not ready,and waits at most 8 seconds;failure is fail-closed and local-model cannot report running. An Ollama instance started by GPTBridge is unloaded by the sleep policy after the configured warm interval;an externally started instance is never stopped by ownership inference.\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
    }
  ]
}
